Trademarks
----------
Yamaha and SEQTRAK are trademarks or registered trademarks of Yamaha
Corporation. This project is an independent, unofficial open-source tool and
is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Yamaha Corporation.

Protocol information (MIDI CC numbers, SysEx addresses and parameter ranges)
is implemented for interoperability based on the publicly available Yamaha
SEQTRAK Data List for OS V2.00 (YJ-D0, 01/2026). The docs/*.tsv files
reproduce factual parameter values (wave, sound and effect tables) as plain
data for interoperability. No manual text, images or layout are redistributed
in this repository.

